      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "INDY ALEX (3) has a strong record this track and trip with two wins and two placings from four starts. In the money last time at Hobart (25.86) in a Free For All, finishing a 1.3 lengths second. Looks well placed and should feature. VISTA YANK (1) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 3.5 lengths at this track in a handy 29.87 beating BUCKLE UP MENZIE. Sure to measure up. LOCHINVAR ANGEL (5) is progressing well scoring last time out (29.79) at this track and bringing up her 4th career win. Has never been out of the money in three starts this distance. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. BROOKDENE (2) did the right thing for favourite backers last time and is in the mix again.",
